1
00:00:36,068 --> 00:00:37,856
We're going to live here from now on.

2
00:00:37,969 --> 00:00:39,797
Thank Uncle Metha, Nava.

3
00:00:39,855 --> 00:00:40,927
Thank you.

4
00:00:41,352 --> 00:00:42,934
You can look around first.

5
00:00:43,245 --> 00:00:43,615
Okay.

6
00:00:44,914 --> 00:00:45,276
Go ahead.

7
00:01:01,254 --> 00:01:01,886
Nam.

8
00:01:02,619 --> 00:01:04,265
Do you think Nava will like my house?

9
00:01:06,402 --> 00:01:07,728
Why wouldn't she?

10
00:01:08,207 --> 00:01:10,099
The old place was terrible.

11
00:01:11,151 --> 00:01:12,503
I should be thanking you

12
00:01:12,562 --> 00:01:14,584
for inviting Nava and me to live here.

13
00:01:16,379 --> 00:01:17,962
I'm happy to do it for you and Nava.

14
00:01:21,965 --> 00:01:23,197
It's a shame

15
00:01:23,452 --> 00:01:24,411
that we met too late.

16
00:01:25,047 --> 00:01:25,713
I...

17
00:01:26,212 --> 00:01:28,132
I wish you were Nava's real father.

18
00:01:29,996 --> 00:01:31,502
Even though I'm not her biological father,

19
00:01:33,601 --> 00:01:34,992
Nava will be my daughter.

20
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:39,887
Thank you.

21
00:01:50,974 --> 00:01:52,463
So, Nava, do you like the house?

22
00:01:52,989 --> 00:01:53,354
Yes.

23
00:01:53,649 --> 00:01:57,604
Mom said you have a big box of colored pencils.

24
00:01:59,050 --> 00:01:59,553
I do.

25
00:02:00,450 --> 00:02:01,383
It's a really big box.

26
00:02:02,705 --> 00:02:03,392
Do you want to see it?

27
00:02:04,861 --> 00:02:05,492
Yes.

28
00:02:09,163 --> 00:02:09,468
Let's go.

29
00:02:14,741 --> 00:02:15,228
Come on.

30
00:02:34,137 --> 00:02:35,511
Things happened so suddenly,

31
00:02:36,189 --> 00:02:37,591
so I haven't had time to decorate your room yet.

32
00:02:38,654 --> 00:02:40,024
If there's anything you want, just tell me.

33
00:02:41,331 --> 00:02:43,835
Uncle Metha, you won't be like Dad, will you?

34
00:02:44,255 --> 00:02:46,492
Dad always made Mom cry.

35
00:02:49,610 --> 00:02:51,089
I'll never be like that.

36
00:02:52,934 --> 00:02:54,593
I'll protect you and your mom.

37
00:02:57,591 --> 00:02:58,338
I promise.

38
00:03:07,969 --> 00:03:08,800
Trust me.

39
00:03:11,019 --> 00:03:12,748
I'll keep that promise with my life.

40
00:03:26,938 --> 00:03:27,867
One box fell.

41
00:03:32,476 --> 00:03:34,080
Thanks for helping me, Nava.

42
00:03:34,733 --> 00:03:36,667
It's no trouble at all, Uncle Metha.

43
00:03:36,990 --> 00:03:37,677
Hmm...

44
00:03:37,785 --> 00:03:39,291
You can stop calling him Uncle.

45
00:03:39,445 --> 00:03:41,405
You can call him Dad now.

46
00:03:42,152 --> 00:03:42,612
Okay

47
00:03:42,667 --> 00:03:43,865
Good girl.

48
00:03:44,047 --> 00:03:46,397
I have a reward for you, too.

49
00:03:48,932 --> 00:03:50,236
Here.

50
00:03:50,600 --> 00:03:52,634
A new coloring book.

51
00:03:52,966 --> 00:03:54,156
Do you like it?

52
00:03:55,281 --> 00:03:56,433
Thank you, Mom.

53
00:03:56,569 --> 00:03:58,838
May I color in it now?

54
00:03:59,046 --> 00:03:59,352
Sure.

55
00:04:09,921 --> 00:04:11,601
By the way, isn't this a little too much stock?

56
00:04:12,936 --> 00:04:14,032
Mr. Pruek said

57
00:04:14,269 --> 00:04:15,600
that if we want to succeed,

58
00:04:15,807 --> 00:04:17,044
we have to be willing to invest.

59
00:04:20,509 --> 00:04:22,234
Is Mr. Pruek really trustworthy, Nam?

60
00:04:23,024 --> 00:04:24,851
Come on, Mr. Pruek...

61
00:04:25,210 --> 00:04:27,338
He's a billionaire socialite.

62
00:04:27,709 --> 00:04:29,400
And his business plan is clear.

63
00:04:30,146 --> 00:04:32,225
Besides, if we hit the target,

64
00:04:32,977 --> 00:04:35,203
we'll get to go to Finland.

65
00:04:35,853 --> 00:04:38,287
You and Nava can see the Northern Lights.

66
00:04:41,639 --> 00:04:42,458
I'm just worried, that's all.

67
00:04:43,177 --> 00:04:44,633
The economy hasn't been doing well lately.

68
00:04:47,391 --> 00:04:48,630
I have a plan.

69
00:05:00,781 --> 00:05:01,562
What's this?

70
00:05:02,417 --> 00:05:03,955
A partner gave it to me.

71
00:05:04,163 --> 00:05:05,816
He said it'll help boost sales,

72
00:05:06,196 --> 00:05:07,876
but we have to worship it every day.

73
00:05:16,925 --> 00:05:19,303
We'll be going to Finland soon.

74
00:06:35,615 --> 00:06:37,228
Well, good morning, Captain.

75
00:06:37,253 --> 00:06:39,263
You're in early today.

76
00:06:39,899 --> 00:06:41,391
Last night's shift was a mess,

77
00:06:41,416 --> 00:06:42,379
so I had to come in and sort it out.

78
00:06:43,914 --> 00:06:46,369
You're really eager to make a name for yourself.

79
00:06:47,221 --> 00:06:48,208
You call this making a name for myself?

80
00:06:49,038 --> 00:06:50,210
All I do is paperwork.

81
00:06:50,235 --> 00:06:52,054
I hardly ever get to work on a major case.

82
00:06:54,276 --> 00:06:55,025
A major case...

83
00:06:55,987 --> 00:06:56,858
Funny you should mention that.

84
00:06:59,110 --> 00:07:00,326
Someone filed a complaint today.

85
00:07:00,691 --> 00:07:03,216
They said they were scammed by Pruek Phana.

86
00:07:05,648 --> 00:07:06,291
Pruek Phana?

87
00:07:06,855 --> 00:07:07,248
Yeah.

88
00:07:08,212 --> 00:07:09,282
That rich socialite?

89
00:07:10,025 --> 00:07:10,543
That's right.

90
00:07:11,362 --> 00:07:12,192
Allegedly,

91
00:07:13,062 --> 00:07:15,060
he got people to invest in a dietary supplement business

92
00:07:15,085 --> 00:07:16,487
then ran off with their money.

93
00:07:17,778 --> 00:07:18,966
There are already several victims.

94
00:07:20,262 --> 00:07:21,796
But there's still a lot to investigate.

95
00:07:22,843 --> 00:07:24,061
If it's true,

96
00:07:24,939 --> 00:07:26,142
it'll be big news.

97
00:07:26,905 --> 00:07:27,455
And...

98
00:07:29,133 --> 00:07:30,106
the amount of money involved?

99
00:07:30,303 --> 00:07:32,127
We're talking billions.

100
00:07:34,312 --> 00:07:35,711
Bring me that complaint form.

101
00:07:36,177 --> 00:07:37,202
Wow.

102
00:07:37,227 --> 00:07:38,669
Getting on it quickly, huh?

103
00:07:38,813 --> 00:07:40,325
Are you trying to become police chief?

104
00:07:42,883 --> 00:07:43,971
I'll handle this case myself.

105
00:07:44,657 --> 00:07:45,325
Sure.

106
00:08:15,496 --> 00:08:16,641
Please wait a moment.

107
00:08:28,217 --> 00:08:29,603
I'm Captain Metha.

108
00:08:30,108 --> 00:08:31,365
I'm here to conduct an investigation

109
00:08:31,915 --> 00:08:34,364
into allegations of fraud against the public.

110
00:08:36,599 --> 00:08:37,324
Officer.

111
00:08:38,610 --> 00:08:40,474
You're making accusations against me.

112
00:08:40,897 --> 00:08:42,277
Do you have any evidence?

113
00:08:44,242 --> 00:08:45,856
I'd like to search the house as well.

114
00:08:46,491 --> 00:08:48,422
And do you have a search warrant?

115
00:08:49,576 --> 00:08:51,147
Without one, this could be

116
00:08:51,210 --> 00:08:52,461
trespassing.

117
00:08:56,910 --> 00:08:58,595
You know exactly what you've done.

118
00:08:59,825 --> 00:09:00,136
Yes.

119
00:09:00,601 --> 00:09:01,228
I do.

120
00:09:02,106 --> 00:09:03,318
I'm running a business.

121
00:09:04,193 --> 00:09:06,931
How can I be blamed

122
00:09:07,765 --> 00:09:08,698
when people choose to invest?

123
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,601
But there are several victims.

124
00:09:12,626 --> 00:09:13,749
Oh, Officer.

125
00:09:14,529 --> 00:09:16,907
I don't think it's right to call them victims.

126
00:09:18,846 --> 00:09:20,558
Why didn't they complain when they were making money?

127
00:09:23,677 --> 00:09:26,778
Business investments always carry risks, Officer.

128
00:09:32,743 --> 00:09:34,200
You think you'll get away with this so easily?

129
00:09:36,471 --> 00:09:37,783
I'll gather all the evidence

130
00:09:39,525 --> 00:09:40,998
and put you behind bars.

131
00:09:44,692 --> 00:09:45,467
Be my guest.

132
00:09:47,250 --> 00:09:50,720
But I do have a golf date with Commander Thongchai.

133
00:09:59,024 --> 00:10:00,449
Once you have a proper search warrant,

134
00:10:01,349 --> 00:10:03,176
we can talk again.

135
00:10:03,828 --> 00:10:04,379
That way, please.

136
00:10:35,206 --> 00:10:39,398
(I will tell you about our new promotion.)

137
00:10:39,493 --> 00:10:40,913
(Here, buy 10, get one free.)

138
00:10:40,940 --> 00:10:42,919
Our current promotion is buy 10, get one free.

139
00:10:43,050 --> 00:10:47,810
(All our ingredients are natural extracts.)

140
00:10:47,835 --> 00:10:51,694
(We guarantee results, with no harmful residues.)

141
00:10:52,343 --> 00:10:54,574
Dad, I'm hungry.

142
00:10:54,662 --> 00:10:56,995
(You can also win a chance to go abroad.)

143
00:10:57,630 --> 00:11:00,186
Oh, hasn't Mom made you anything to eat?

144
00:11:00,733 --> 00:11:01,676
(Are you interested?)

145
00:11:01,862 --> 00:11:03,700
(Buy 10, get one free.)

146
00:11:04,283 --> 00:11:05,373
(That is today's promotion.)

147
00:11:05,581 --> 00:11:07,130
Nam, aren't you going to eat?

148
00:11:07,848 --> 00:11:09,780
Why don't you take a break and eat?

149
00:11:11,445 --> 00:11:14,785
(Yes, it contains both vitamin C and multivitamins.)

150
00:11:15,462 --> 00:11:18,364
Yes, it's made from natural extracts.

151
00:11:19,268 --> 00:11:19,705
Let's go.

152
00:11:20,354 --> 00:11:22,727
(Yes, buy 10, get one free.)

153
00:11:22,892 --> 00:11:24,177
(Hurry and place your orders.)

154
00:11:24,202 --> 00:11:25,372
(Buy 10, get one free.)

155
00:11:25,697 --> 00:11:27,034
If you'd like to become a member,

156
00:11:27,241 --> 00:11:28,976
you can sign up right now.

157
00:11:29,073 --> 00:11:31,015
We guarantee a minimum income

158
00:11:31,274 --> 00:11:32,937
of 50,000 baht a month.

159
00:11:32,962 --> 00:11:34,621
That's just the minimum.

160
00:11:34,676 --> 00:11:35,674
As for our vitamins,

161
00:11:35,952 --> 00:11:37,869
they're made from natural extracts.

162
00:11:37,894 --> 00:11:41,773
They have no side effects and leave no harmful residue.

163
00:12:50,841 --> 00:12:52,115
Did you see that?

164
00:13:04,455 --> 00:13:04,892
Eat!

165
00:13:06,466 --> 00:13:07,646
I said eat!

166
00:13:09,064 --> 00:13:09,571
Eat!

167
00:13:10,029 --> 00:13:10,794
Eat!

168
00:13:11,550 --> 00:13:12,079
Eat!

169
00:13:12,144 --> 00:13:13,262
Nam, stop!

170
00:13:14,874 --> 00:13:15,720
What's going on?

171
00:13:18,047 --> 00:13:19,677
I just want Nava to eat more.

172
00:13:24,475 --> 00:13:26,120
It's okay, Nava.

173
00:13:26,811 --> 00:13:28,198
If you don't want to eat, you don't have to.

174
00:13:38,310 --> 00:13:38,719
Wait.

175
00:13:44,958 --> 00:13:47,549
Right now, I'm gathering evidence against Pruek.

176
00:13:48,793 --> 00:13:49,583
Just wait a little longer.

177
00:13:51,013 --> 00:13:51,874
I'll help you.

178
00:13:51,899 --> 00:13:52,253
No!

179
00:13:53,692 --> 00:13:54,375
It's okay.

180
00:14:01,035 --> 00:14:02,218
Everything's fine now.

181
00:16:34,412 --> 00:16:35,399
You're not getting away.

182
00:16:38,717 --> 00:16:39,849
Hey.

183
00:16:39,874 --> 00:16:41,867
Thot, perfect timing.

184
00:16:41,982 --> 00:16:43,796
I've almost finished compiling the evidence against Pruek.

185
00:16:44,177 --> 00:16:44,783
All that's left is...

186
00:16:44,808 --> 00:16:45,583
Metha.!

187
00:16:46,089 --> 00:16:46,751
Stop.

188
00:16:48,606 --> 00:16:49,289
The Pruek case...

189
00:16:53,903 --> 00:16:54,828
It's been thrown out.

190
00:16:57,166 --> 00:16:58,763
What do you mean?

191
00:17:08,918 --> 00:17:14,995
(Pruek Phana held a press conference.)

192
00:17:15,445 --> 00:17:19,312
He said he had no involvement

193
00:17:19,337 --> 00:17:23,148
in the manager's alleged mismanagement,

194
00:17:23,797 --> 00:17:25,560
and insisted

195
00:17:25,585 --> 00:17:28,517
that he was innocent of all charges.

196
00:17:28,542 --> 00:17:37,190
He also said he was willing to cooperate with the police.

197
00:17:42,349 --> 00:17:43,189
Mom.

198
00:17:44,447 --> 00:17:45,555
Mom.

199
00:19:05,203 --> 00:19:05,837
Metha.

200
00:19:07,343 --> 00:19:07,899
Metha.

201
00:19:08,807 --> 00:19:09,996
Come look at this. Hurry.

202
00:19:11,108 --> 00:19:11,894
Hurry!

203
00:19:12,018 --> 00:19:13,290
What's going on?

204
00:19:18,439 --> 00:19:19,905
Are you ready?

205
00:19:20,158 --> 00:19:23,572
I'm taking you to kill that man, Pruek.

206
00:19:28,592 --> 00:19:29,095
Let's go.

207
00:20:12,235 --> 00:20:12,988
Officer!

208
00:20:19,454 --> 00:20:21,274
Officer, help me! This woman has gone crazy!

209
00:20:21,299 --> 00:20:22,153
Don't move!

210
00:20:27,688 --> 00:20:28,642
Shh.

211
00:20:51,215 --> 00:20:52,445
Let Pruek go.

212
00:20:55,182 --> 00:20:56,691
It's not too late.

213
00:20:59,270 --> 00:21:00,836
We can still go home.

214
00:21:03,815 --> 00:21:04,984
Nam.

215
00:21:05,523 --> 00:21:07,006
Why are you helping him?

216
00:21:07,065 --> 00:21:08,040
Nava.

217
00:21:08,288 --> 00:21:08,866
Nava.

218
00:21:10,022 --> 00:21:11,178
Nava's waiting.

219
00:21:15,727 --> 00:21:18,352
If the law can't do anything to him,

220
00:21:21,890 --> 00:21:23,819
I'll punish him myself.

221
00:21:42,108 --> 00:21:42,774
Nam.

222
00:21:49,085 --> 00:21:50,379
Put the knife down.

223
00:21:51,056 --> 00:21:52,231
It's over.

224
00:22:22,073 --> 00:22:23,876
It's over.

225
00:22:26,425 --> 00:22:27,738
Let's go home.

226
00:22:30,918 --> 00:22:31,980
It's over.

227
00:22:36,227 --> 00:22:37,116
Yes

228
00:22:56,683 --> 00:22:57,621
Nam!

229
00:23:02,582 --> 00:23:04,155
Call an ambulance!

230
00:23:04,814 --> 00:23:05,327
Hurry!

231
00:23:39,840 --> 00:23:40,289
Hey.

232
00:23:43,178 --> 00:23:44,524
It's not your fault.

233
00:23:49,198 --> 00:23:50,832
But I couldn't save anyone.

234
00:23:54,968 --> 00:23:56,949
What's the point of being a police officer?

235
00:24:10,620 --> 00:24:12,241
(Nam!)

236
00:24:19,754 --> 00:24:21,616
Why did you let me die?

237
00:24:37,753 --> 00:24:39,367
Why didn't you help me?

238
00:24:41,414 --> 00:24:42,194
You're a police officer,

239
00:24:42,721 --> 00:24:44,212
but you can't catch the bad guy.

240
00:24:48,755 --> 00:24:49,088
Nam.

241
00:24:52,147 --> 00:24:53,257
I'm sorry.

242
00:24:54,198 --> 00:24:56,669
It's my fault I couldn't help you.

243
00:24:58,567 --> 00:25:00,197
Then take responsibility.

244
00:25:02,930 --> 00:25:03,973
You promised

245
00:25:04,488 --> 00:25:06,307
you'd protect me with your life.

246
00:25:06,628 --> 00:25:07,038
Huh?

247
00:25:08,229 --> 00:25:08,921
Right?

248
00:25:09,453 --> 00:25:10,587
Metha.

249
00:25:12,890 --> 00:25:14,297
Don't answer her!

250
00:25:16,949 --> 00:25:17,856
Get a hold of yourself!

251
00:25:18,898 --> 00:25:20,649
Are you going to throw your life away here?

252
00:25:21,428 --> 00:25:23,369
You said you had Nava to raise.

253
00:25:24,537 --> 00:25:26,125
And we don't even know if that's really Nam.

254
00:25:30,538 --> 00:25:31,717
Think carefully.

255
00:25:35,440 --> 00:25:36,702
(Thank you)

256
00:25:43,563 --> 00:25:43,970
No.

257
00:25:48,828 --> 00:25:49,610
This is not Nam.

258
00:26:11,566 --> 00:26:13,272
Then who do you think it is?

259
00:26:20,624 --> 00:26:21,289
Dear.

260
00:26:22,400 --> 00:26:24,430
Go get the stuffed rabbit from the locker room.

261
00:26:24,455 --> 00:26:25,492
Okay.

262
00:26:46,942 --> 00:26:47,949
Smells good.

263
00:26:49,186 --> 00:26:50,375
Looks tasty.

264
00:26:58,576 --> 00:26:59,918
Metha.

265
00:27:01,439 --> 00:27:03,190
Metha, I'm sorry.

266
00:27:05,331 --> 00:27:06,988
Please don't be angry with me.

267
00:27:07,741 --> 00:27:09,230
Please, Metha.

268
00:27:11,387 --> 00:27:13,194
Don't stay silent.

269
00:27:14,699 --> 00:27:16,308
You can't fool me.

270
00:27:45,466 --> 00:27:46,047
Cherd.

271
00:27:46,113 --> 00:27:49,010
Perfect timing. Help Metha, quick!

272
00:27:52,398 --> 00:27:53,625
I can't help, Dear.

273
00:27:55,672 --> 00:27:57,263
You're the store manager.

274
00:27:57,328 --> 00:27:58,629
You have to be able to do something.

275
00:28:03,808 --> 00:28:05,237
Every man for himself.

276
00:28:06,268 --> 00:28:08,618
So you're just going to let Metha die?

277
00:29:24,940 --> 00:29:26,286
Are you hungry, ma'am?

278
00:29:28,632 --> 00:29:30,219
We have special promotions today.

279
00:29:31,890 --> 00:29:33,531
Ready-to-eat meals are 30% off.

280
00:29:33,722 --> 00:29:35,253
Buy two chicken sausages, get one free.

281
00:29:35,278 --> 00:29:36,973
Sandwiches paired with drinks at a special price.

282
00:29:37,202 --> 00:29:37,897
And...

283
00:29:37,922 --> 00:29:38,560
we also have

284
00:29:38,585 --> 00:29:40,988
discounted desserts, cakes, and puddings.

285
00:29:55,930 --> 00:29:57,427
What did you say?

286
